+`patches/` is the exception that proves the rule: it holds *proposed upstream*
+harness changes for extension points this plugin still needs (the requests,
+evidence, and discussion links live in `.dsh-migrate/patch-reports/`). Those
+proposals are not applied by the plugin and are not prerequisites — every
+shipped surface keeps working through its documented fallback — so a release
+must build, typecheck, and pass its tests against an unpatched harness.
+
